# Copy to .env and fill in. `zeos-stretch run` and `zeos-stretch serve` read this file,
# from the current directory and then the project root. A variable already set in the
# environment wins over it, and a command-line flag wins over both. The names are the
# Claude SDK's own, so a shell already set up for Claude needs no .env at all.
#
# None of this is needed by the tapes, the lint or the test suite. Only
# `--machine claude` wants a key.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Overridden by --model. Opus by default: a behaviour resuming after the smoke alarm has
# to work out from its resume notice that the coffee is no longer in its gripper.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
